 "fieldData": {
  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Feedback Survey Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a customer feedback survey?\", \"a\": \"A customer feedback survey is a short questionnaire sent after one moment, like a first delivery or a support call. It collects reasons in the customer's own words, where a satisfaction survey tracks a score over time. Both kinds of customer surveys can live in one app.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I create a customer feedback survey?\", \"a\": \"Pick the moment you want to hear about, such as a first delivery or a closed support ticket, and what you will change based on the replies. Describe both in a prompt, and Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-survey-and-quiz-builder'>AI survey builder</a> drafts the questions, the send trigger, and the table that stores every reply.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do you write a good customer survey?\", \"a\": \"Write each question the way a customer will read it on a phone, in neutral words. Ask \\\"How was your visit?\\\" instead of \\\"How much did you enjoy your visit?\\\", because wording and question order both shift the answers. Drop any question whose answer would not change what you do.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are some good survey questions to collect customer feedback?\", \"a\": \"Good questions name one moment and leave room for a reason. Start these survey questions for customers with a rating of the delivery, then ask for the main reason behind it. Buyers who nearly left can also say what almost stopped them from ordering. To follow one score over time, a customer satisfaction survey repeats the same rating at fixed points.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are typical customer service survey questions?\", \"a\": \"Typical customer service survey questions ask whether the issue was resolved and how the agent handled it, then leave an open box for what could have gone better. If you also track a customer effort score, keep it in the same app so each rating sits beside its comment. A week later, send one more question: did the problem stay fixed?\"}, {\"q\": \"Is there a customer feedback survey template?\", \"a\": \"Yes. A post-onboarding check-in and a delivery survey are two common first drafts. Start from either one, then reword any question with a follow-up prompt instead of editing fields by hand.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should customer feedback survey software do?\", \"a\": \"Good customer feedback survey software lets you skip anyone who answered in the last month, because nobody wants a survey after every order. A customer should be able to reply straight from the email or text, with no login. With Emergent, each reply lands in a database you own, not in a survey vendor's account.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do you choose customer survey tools?\", \"a\": \"Judge customer survey tools by what happens after a reply arrives. Check that an open answer can be tagged and sent to its owner, and that replies in other languages still get read. Then read the plan limits, since some plans cap responses or bill for each one past the cap. Emergent builds the survey and its routing from a prompt, and paid plans can export the code to your GitHub.\"}, {\"q\": \"Is there a free customer feedback survey?\", \"a\": \"Yes. Emergent is free to start, and the free tier covers building and publishing the survey. Responses have no cap, and a busy month never stops collection. Add an NPS survey to the same app later if you want a loyalty score beside the comments.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should a customer service survey template include?\", \"a\": \"A customer service survey template should carry the ticket number and the agent's name as hidden fields, filled in before the customer opens it. Set it to send when the ticket closes. A rule for reopened tickets keeps anyone from being surveyed twice about one problem.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
